msgid "Site moved? Re-enable it"
msgstr "¿Se ha movido el sitio? Vuelve a activarlas"

#: includes/helpers.php:2602
msgid "Abilities are pinned to the address they were switched on for, so a clone cannot inherit them. A host that hands out new URLs trips this routinely — the check offers the button."
