msgstr "Tus diseños de Figma, ahora dentro de WordPress"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:325
msgid "Pull frames — or an entire team — into a local library with their images and CSS tokens. Then just say the word: NibWP AI builds them with whichever page builder you already run."
msgstr "Importa marcos (o un equipo entero) a una biblioteca local con sus imágenes y tokens CSS. Luego solo tienes que pedirlo: la IA de NibWP los construye con el constructor de páginas que ya uses."

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:327
msgid "Read-only, never edits your designs"
msgstr "Solo lectura, nunca edita tus diseños"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:328
msgid "Colors &amp; type extracted automatically"
msgstr "Colores y tipografía extraídos automáticamente"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:329
msgid "Etch · Bricks · Elementor · Gutenberg & more"
msgstr "Etch · Bricks · Elementor · Gutenberg y más"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:335
msgid "Takes about two minutes"
msgstr "Tarda unos dos minutos"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:379
msgid "The Figma integration is a Pro feature. Activate a NibWP Pro, Bundle, or Figma Skill license to connect."
msgstr "La integración con Figma es una función Pro. Activa una licencia de NibWP Pro, Bundle o de la skill Figma para conectar."

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:403
msgctxt "badge"
